	"notice": "CC numbers are checked against the manufacturer manual. Connect a MIDI output to the matching input and enable MIDI/CC reception in the device settings. MIDI channel is user-selectable; no USB port-name aliases are assumed. The drawing is a partial grouped control inventory, not a scale panel layout. Touch-key note bindings are virtual defaults and may require octave adjustment. Menu-dependent controls are not automatically bound. NRPN, SysEx preset/sequence transfers, firmware updates and multi-message operations require a protocol-aware application and are not implemented by these static controls.",
